{
    "title": "SDownloader - Video Downloader",
    "description": "\ud83c\udf1f SDownloader is a video and image downloader app to download videos from any website and social apps, such as <b>TT (without watermark), FB, IG</b>, etc. All formats are supported. \r\n\r\nYou can browse websites using the built-in browser, and the app will immediately <b>auto-detect the videos</b> on the website. Download any video you like here for <b>free, fast, safe, and easy</b>. After downloading, the video can be played offline!\r\n\r\n<b>Key Features:</b>\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Download videos from websites.\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Download videos from social media like IG, Twi, TT, FB...\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Download TT videos without the watermark!\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Share downloaded videos and pictures on all social apps.\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Auto detect videos and easily download all video, music, and movie files.\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Download by the built-in download manager.\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Play videos offline with the self-developed player.\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Support resolutions like 480p, 720p, 1080p or even HD.\r\n\ud83d\udc8e All download formats supported, JPG, PNG, MP3, M4A, MP4, M4V, MOV, AVI, WMV, etc\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Support for screen projection and speed playback.\r\n\ud83d\udc8e SD card supported\r\n\r\n1\ufe0f\u20e3 <b>Excellent Video Downloader</b>\r\nSDownloader supports downloading with video URLs or browsing videos with the built-in browser. The downloader instantly detects videos while you are browsing. Preview the video first, tap to download fast at high speed, and play it offline.\r\n\r\n2\ufe0f\u20e3 <b>Social media video downloader</b>\r\nSDownloader supports video and picture download for almost all social media apps and websites. You just need to copy the link of the video and paste it into the downloader. Our download manager will fetch all the details and start downloading within seconds.\r\n\r\n3\ufe0f\u20e3 <b>Browser Downloader</b>\r\nSupport the direct detection and downloading of videos from the browser. When you are browsing videos on the web, the app will automatically sense them. You are able to download the video with just one click.\r\n\r\n4\ufe0f\u20e3 <b>Full-featured Video Player</b>\r\nSDownloader supports fast and stable 4K/UHD video playback. It's a powerful all-format video player. Play all HD, UHD, 4K, 1080P videos fast. Try it now!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca1 How to download from social Apps like IG or TT \ud83d\udca1\r\n\u2460 Open the social app and tap the Share icon\r\n\u2461 Tap Copy Link\r\n\u2462 Return to the SDownloader\r\n\u2463 Wait for the auto-detect and download\r\n\u2464 Video downloaded!\r\n\r\nSocial media downloader & video downloader for FB & SDownloader is the easiest and safest social media video saver to save stories & download videos & photos from IG. Super fast & easy video downloader. With one click you can download videos from IG, Twi, TT, and FB... And play offline or share with your friends. Download this fast video downloader & story downloader to save Twit, TT, and videos easily!\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\n- Before re-uploading the video, please get the permission of the author of the video.\r\n- We are not responsible for intellectual property infringement by reposting someone else's content without permission.\r\n- Downloading of files is prohibited by national law and copyright is prohibited.\r\n- SDownloader is not officially associated with IG, FB, Twi, TT, etc.",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83c\udf1f SDownloader is a video and image downloader app to download videos from any website and social apps, such as <b>TT (without watermark), FB, IG</b>, etc. All formats are supported. <br><br>You can browse websites using the built-in browser, and the app will immediately <b>auto-detect the videos</b> on the website. Download any video you like here for <b>free, fast, safe, and easy</b>. After downloading, the video can be played offline!<br><br><b>Key Features:</b><br>\ud83d\udc8e Download videos from websites.<br>\ud83d\udc8e Download videos from social media like IG, Twi, TT, FB...<br>\ud83d\udc8e Download TT videos without the watermark!<br>\ud83d\udc8e Share downloaded videos and pictures on all social apps.<br>\ud83d\udc8e Auto detect videos and easily download all video, music, and movie files.<br>\ud83d\udc8e Download by the built-in download manager.<br>\ud83d\udc8e Play videos offline with the self-developed player.<br>\ud83d\udc8e Support resolutions like 480p, 720p, 1080p or even HD.<br>\ud83d\udc8e All download formats supported, JPG, PNG, MP3, M4A, MP4, M4V, MOV, AVI, WMV, etc<br>\ud83d\udc8e Support for screen projection and speed playback.<br>\ud83d\udc8e SD card supported<br><br>1\ufe0f\u20e3 <b>Excellent Video Downloader</b><br>SDownloader supports downloading with video URLs or browsing videos with the built-in browser. The downloader instantly detects videos while you are browsing. Preview the video first, tap to download fast at high speed, and play it offline.<br><br>2\ufe0f\u20e3 <b>Social media video downloader</b><br>SDownloader supports video and picture download for almost all social media apps and websites. You just need to copy the link of the video and paste it into the downloader. Our download manager will fetch all the details and start downloading within seconds.<br><br>3\ufe0f\u20e3 <b>Browser Downloader</b><br>Support the direct detection and downloading of videos from the browser. When you are browsing videos on the web, the app will automatically sense them. You are able to download the video with just one click.<br><br>4\ufe0f\u20e3 <b>Full-featured Video Player</b><br>SDownloader supports fast and stable 4K/UHD video playback. It&#39;s a powerful all-format video player. Play all HD, UHD, 4K, 1080P videos fast. Try it now!<br><br>\ud83d\udca1 How to download from social Apps like IG or TT \ud83d\udca1<br>\u2460 Open the social app and tap the Share icon<br>\u2461 Tap Copy Link<br>\u2462 Return to the SDownloader<br>\u2463 Wait for the auto-detect and download<br>\u2464 Video downloaded!<br><br>Social media downloader &amp; video downloader for FB &amp; SDownloader is the easiest and safest social media video saver to save stories &amp; download videos &amp; photos from IG. Super fast &amp; easy video downloader. With one click you can download videos from IG, Twi, TT, and FB... And play offline or share with your friends. Download this fast video downloader &amp; story downloader to save Twit, TT, and videos easily!<br><br>Disclaimer:<br>- Before re-uploading the video, please get the permission of the author of the video.<br>- We are not responsible for intellectual property infringement by reposting someone else&#39;s content without permission.<br>- Downloading of files is prohibited by national law and copyright is prohibited.<br>- SDownloader is not officially associated with IG, FB, Twi, TT, etc.",
